==Battleground==
*12 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*4 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 15~30 seconds<sup>450f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Shampoo (Enemy)|Shampoo]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
All enemies in this level are red, apart from Shampoo. Any [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]] will easily be enough for this stage, such as [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Swordsman Cat]] or [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bath Cat]].

